Done waiting: take conversations you wrote last off Waiting on until a new message arrives in them

Usage: mxr desk dismiss [OPTIONS] <THREAD_IDS>...

Arguments:
  <THREAD_IDS>...  Thread ids, as `mxr desk --format ids` prints them

Options:
      --dry-run          Show which conversations would be dismissed without changing anything
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
